---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import SectionContainer from "../../ui/SectionContainer.astro";
import sukkahImage from "../../../assets/images/pergoloft/pergoloft-image-g.webp";
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-24 md:py-28 bg-[#f5f6f6]">
  <SectionContainer>
    <div
      class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.18fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start"
    >
      <div class="text-left max-w-[31rem]">
        <p class="text-primary/90 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-5">
          Next Level Experience
        </p>

        <h2
          class="font-sans text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-[40px] font-medium leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.02em] text-gray-900 mb-9"
        >
          Seamless Integration with <br />
          <span class="text-primary italic">The Instant Sukkah</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-7 text-gray-600 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-[1.45] max-w-[34ch]">
          <p>
            Designed for combined functionality and ease, the Instant Sukkah is
            the only structure that brings interior design outdoors in less than
            a minute. Comprised of sleek metal frames and premium grade PVC, the
            innovation is in the setup.
          </p>
          <p>
            PergoLoft integrates seamlessly with the Instant Sukkah, and allows
            you to extend your space well beyond the holiday season, creating a
            year-round, hassle-free outdoor lounging experience.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:pt-12 h-full">
        <div class="rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden shadow-lg h-full " >
          <Image
            src={sukkahImage}
            alt="Pergoloft integrated with Instant Sukkah enclosure"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover aspect-[16/10]"
            loading="lazy"
            quality={90}
            format="webp"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </SectionContainer>
</section>
